# The Docker build context is the repo root (the images need the whole pnpm
# workspace). Keep it to source + manifests + the lockfile; everything here
# is either regenerated by `pnpm install` / `pnpm build` inside the image, or
# irrelevant to it.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.output
**/.netlify
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/storybook-static
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Regenerated by TanStack Router's Vite plugin during `pnpm build`.
**/routeTree.gen.ts

# Never bake secrets into an image layer. compose.yaml passes env at runtime.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.github
.changeset
.claude
.vscode
infra
supabase/.temp
supabase/.branches
**/.DS_Store
